          "title": "Place it",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p><strong>MGRS ✓</strong> shows the grid is set. Tap <strong>Place</strong> and the mark goes straight there.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/06506980864eae35.webp",
